      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we are no longer modifying `this` in `makeWithLocalMatrix` I no longer need this function, I did change the flags to a bitmask. \n\nI also changed the naming to `LocalMatrixFlags::kHasPerspective` since it\u0027s more clear and it would make sense for both flags to be enabled since for example, if a picture shader was made the resulting keys would be like `LMS(PictureShader)` where the LMS has the flag `LocalMatrixFlags::kIncludeWithOutVariant`, then if that was wrapped once again with a LMS that has perspective like `LMS(LMS(PictureShader)) -\u003e LMS(PictureShader)` then we apply the perspective flag, so now the LMS has both possible flags, that way the number of intrinsic combinations stays 3.",
